e. Every player of a club moves by one whole number and its best few by one more, held to 1–99 and never past a teammate rated above him, whichever brings the club nearest its target: −3 to +4 points this season. The results count twice, by design: the credit's points for and against place a club's players at their positions and weigh its offence against its defence, and the move then sets the club's level from its margins, wherever the credit left it. Facts from Pro Football Archives; the weights tuned once on 2001–2005 against the next season's Madden launch ratings, then frozen."},"map":"nfl1980","clubs":[{"id":"nfl-new-england-patriots","name":"New England Patriots","code":"NEP","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 143)","str":84.1,"squad":[["Steve Grogan","QB",73],["Matt Cavanaugh","QB",72],["Don Calhoun","RB",92],["Vagas Ferguson","RB",89],["Andy Johnson","RB",67],["Stanley Morgan","WR",97],["Harold Jackson","WR",84],["Carlos Pennywell","WR",63],["Don Westbrook","WR",63],["Russ Francis","TE",99],["Don Hasselbeck","TE",64],["Bill Lenkaitis","OL",96],["Dwight Wheeler","OL",96],["John Hannah","OL",96],["Shelby Jordan","OL",96],["Sam Adams","OL",76],["Bob Cryder","OL",58],["Garry Puetz","OL",54],["Julius Adams","DL",87],["Ray Hamilton","DL",86],["Mel Lunsford","DL",69],["Richard Bishop","DL",69],["Tony McGee","DL",68],["Doug McDougald","DL",60],["Rod Shoate","LB",95],["Mike Hawkins","LB",86],["Steve Nelson","LB",79],["Ray Clayborn","CB",84],["Mike Haynes","CB",72],["Rick Sanford","CB",71],["Tim Fox","S",77],["Roland James","S",71],["Bill Currier","S",57],["John Smith","K",99]]},{"id":"nfl-dallas-cowboys","name":"Dallas Cowboys","code":"DAL","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 44)","str":82.7,"squad":[["Danny White","QB",83],["Glenn Carano","QB",67],["Tony Dorsett","RB",93],["Robert Newhouse","RB",78],["Tony Hill","WR",89],["Drew Pearson","WR",79],["Butch Johnson","WR",70],["Billy Joe DuPree","TE",84],["Jay Saldi","TE",67],["Herbe